@startuml
title Device-Event über Subscribe- und Unsubscribe-Streams

autonumber
hide footbox

actor Client
participant "DeviceIntegrationServiceProxy\n(Client.Contracts)" as ClientProxy
participant DeviceIntegrationService as ClientService
participant JobFacade as Facade
participant "StreamTrackingJobTransmitter\n<Subscribe>" as SubscribeTx
participant "JobTransmitter\n<Subscribe>" as SubscribeInner
participant "StreamTrackingJobTransmitter\n<Unsubscribe>" as UnsubscribeTx
participant DeviceIntegrationWorkerService as WorkerService
participant "WorkerServiceProxy\n(Integration.Contracts)" as WorkerProxy
participant "EventWorkRunner\n<IntegrationDeviceEventDto>" as EventRunner
participant IDeviceIntegration as Integration

note over SubscribeTx,EventRunner
  Subscribe und Unsubscribe sind zwei verpflichtende, beim
  Start geöffnete Streams. Technisch überträgt gRPC jeweils
  ein IAsyncEnumerable<T>; das Naming bleibt trotzdem Stream.
end note

EventRunner -> Integration : DeviceEvent-Handler anmelden

Client -> ClientProxy : SubscribeDeviceEvents(deviceId)
ClientProxy -> ClientService : gRPC-Stream öffnen
ClientService -> Facade : SubscribeEndpoint(subscribe, unsubscribe, service)
Facade -> SubscribeTx : Subscribe-Job senden
SubscribeTx -> SubscribeInner : delegieren
SubscribeInner --> WorkerService : JobRequest<EmptyDto>
WorkerService --> WorkerProxy : gRPC-Nachricht
WorkerProxy --> EventRunner : Subscribe-Stream liefert Request
EventRunner -> EventRunner : request.JobId registrieren

loop solange das Client-Abonnement aktiv ist
  Integration -> EventRunner : DeviceEvent(sender, event)
  EventRunner -> WorkerProxy : SendDeviceEvent(JobResult mit service)
  WorkerProxy -> WorkerService : unary gRPC-Aufruf
  WorkerService -> SubscribeTx : NotifyEventResult(result)
  SubscribeTx -> SubscribeInner : delegieren
  SubscribeInner --> Facade : Event für Subscription
  Facade --> ClientService : event
  ClientService --> ClientProxy : gRPC-Nachricht
  ClientProxy --> Client : event
end

Client -> ClientProxy : Stream beenden
ClientProxy -> ClientService : Cancellation
ClientService -> Facade : Enumerator wird beendet
Facade -> UnsubscribeTx : Unsubscribe-Job senden
UnsubscribeTx --> WorkerService : über inneren JobTransmitter
WorkerService --> WorkerProxy : gRPC-Nachricht
WorkerProxy --> EventRunner : Unsubscribe-Stream liefert Request
EventRunner -> EventRunner : request.JobId entfernen

note over Facade,EventRunner
  Das generische EventWorkRunner-/JobFacade-Verhalten wird
  wiederverwendet. Ein zusätzlicher EventHub ist nicht nötig.
end note
@enduml
